---
import Divider from "@/components/common/Divider.astro";
---

<section class="bg-third-100 py-10 lg:py-20 px-4 lg:px-0">
  <div class="max-w-96 lg:container mx-auto flex flex-col lg:flex-row-reverse gap-10 lg:gap-28 justify-center">
    <div
      class="relative after:content-[''] after:absolute after:inset-5 after:border after:border-white after:pointer-events-none"
    >
      <img
        src="/images/dresscode.webp"
        alt="Dress code"
        class="w-full h-80 lg:w-130 lg:h-140 object-cover"
      />
    </div>
    <article class="flex flex-col justify-center text-center lg:text-right">
      <small class="uppercase tracking-wider text-main-500 mb-2">Dress code</small>
      <h1 class="font-subtitle text-4xl lg:text-5xl italic">Formal</h1>
      <Divider color="red" className="my-5 lg:w-46 lg:ml-auto" />
      <p class="lg:text-lg max-w-94">
        Queremos que disfrutes esta celebración con nosotros. Te invitamos a
        vestir de manera formal y elegante para la ocasión.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
</section>
